    "text": "<p>An inclined plane making an angle of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math> with the horizontal is placed in a uniform horizontal electric field <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>200</mn><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mfrac></math> as shown in the figure. A body of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math>&nbsp;and charge <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mC</mi></math> is allowed to slide down from rest at a height of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>. If the coefficient of friction is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo></math> find the time taken by the body to reach the bottom.<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/636ec3f8-10df-4fb9-a496-c621b8490e64-image.png\" style=\"width: 280px; height: 160px;\" /></p>",
